WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.102 --> 00:00:09.332
In this video you’ll build a full parking map by answering four numbers, then tidy

2
00:00:09.332 --> 00:00:10.927
it up to match your site.

3
00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:17.687
On the Maps page, find your site and choose Add the first map.

4
00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:22.877
If the site already has a map, use Add map instead.

5
00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:28.382
Give the map a name your team will recognize, like Main garage.

6
00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:32.852
Build it for me is already picked.

7
00:00:32.852 --> 00:00:35.334
Now the four answers.

8
00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:39.685
Floors. Use one for a surface lot.

9
00:00:39.685 --> 00:00:41.865
Our garage has two.

10
00:00:42.317 --> 00:00:48.581
Rows per floor. Rows are lettered A, B, C, and so on.

11
00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.117
We have four.

12
00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:57.250
Spaces per row. They’re numbered one, two, three.

13
00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.568
We’ll say twelve.

14
00:01:00.019 --> 00:01:06.519
And accessible spaces. They go at the start of row A.

15
00:01:06.971 --> 00:01:09.496
The preview updates as you type.

16
00:01:09.496 --> 00:01:13.914
Lanes, the entrance, ramps and stairs are added for you.

17
00:01:13.914 --> 00:01:17.780
Check each floor with the tabs under the preview.

18
00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:22.516
The button says how many spaces you’ll get.

19
00:01:22.516 --> 00:01:24.310
Choose Create map.

20
00:01:24.762 --> 00:01:27.205
Here’s your map in the editor.

21
00:01:27.205 --> 00:01:33.476
Each space number starts with the floor, then the row letter, then the space.

22
00:01:33.476 --> 00:01:35.023
So this one is 1A1.

23
00:01:35.477 --> 00:01:38.389
Now tidy it up to match your site.

24
00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:42.416
Click a row, and its settings open on the left.

25
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:45.414
Say this row really has ten spaces.

26
00:01:45.414 --> 00:01:47.213
Change Spaces to ten.

27
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:51.798
To change one space, double-click it.

28
00:01:51.798 --> 00:01:56.266
Here we make space 1D6 a reserved space.

29
00:01:56.718 --> 00:02:02.018
Switch floors with the tabs at the bottom.

30
00:02:02.469 --> 00:02:06.205
Everything saves as you go. You’ll see Saved at the top.

31
00:02:06.205 --> 00:02:11.541
Your team won’t see any of this until you publish, which is two videos from now.
